BSFryq4qpAxUIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAE=&rs=AOn4CLDrRJ8hHrLG4q2YpvlTiy5zsunk_w", "height": 188, "width": 336, "preference": -7, "id": "38", "resolution": "336x188"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/DlITOOkiG3I/hqdefault.webp", "height": 360, "width": 480, "preference": -6, "id": "39", "resolution": "480x360"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DlITOOkiG3I/sddefault.jpg", "preference": -5, "id": "40"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/DlITOOkiG3I/sddefault.webp", "height": 480, "width": 640, "preference": -4, "id": "41", "resolution": "640x480"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DlITOOkiG3I/hq720.jpg", "preference": -3, "id": "42"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/DlITOOkiG3I/hq720.webp", "preference": -2, "id": "43"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DlITOOkiG3I/maxresdefault.jpg", "height": 1080, "width": 1920, "preference": -1, "id": "44", "resolution": "1920x1080"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/DlITOOkiG3I/maxresdefault.webp", "height": 1080, "width": 1920, "preference": 0, "id": "45", "resolution": "1920x1080"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/DlITOOkiG3I/maxresdefault.webp", "description": "\"#shippingbills #digitalshippingbills #regulariseshippingbills #shippingcharges\n\nICICI Bank Trade Online portal empowers you to submit trade transaction request online. You can submit requests for regularising your shipping bills digitally from trade online. Watch the video, to know more on how to regularise your shipping bills digitally.\n\nTo access\n- Login to ICICI Bank Corporate Internet Banking.\n- Navigate to Trade - Trade Services - Trade Online.\n- Go to the Exports tab and click on dashboard.\n- It will display the summary of outstanding shipping bills to be regularised.\n- On the right side of the screen, click on Map Remittances to shipping bills.\n- To proceed, all the available inward remittances will be displayed.\n- Select any inward remittances and click on details, for viewing information of the selected remittances.\n- Post reviewing, select the relevant inward remittances and click on Map to Shipping Bills.\n- On the next screen, the list of outstanding shipping bills will be displayed.\n- Select all the shipping bills, which needs to be regularised against the inward remittances.\n- Then click on proceed to invoice details.\n- You can also use the search tab to find on bill number, bill date, bill amount, outstanding amount and available amount.\n- On the next screen you will get invoice details of all the shipping bills, fill the details like invoice date, invoice amount to be regularised and operative account number.\n- Click on Proceed.\n- Upload the bill of leading and the invoice for the selected shipping bills.\n- Click on submit.\n- On the review screen utilisation detail summary of the inward remittances and shipping bills will be displayed, review the details and click on submit.\n- On clicking on submit the request get submitted to the authoriser and the track reference number will be generated.\n\nPost login the Authoriser can see the request pending for approval under Checker Actionable section of e-Docs dashboard. They can click on approval.\n\nTo know more about Bill Regularisation:\nhttps://www.icicibank.com/business-banking/product-catalogue/product/cross-border-business/export-bill-regularisation.html?ITM=nli_cms_BUSINESS_export_bill_topnavigation\n\nTo know more about ICICI Corporate Internet Banking:\nhttps://www.icicibank.com/corporate/corporate/corporate.page\n\nSubscribe to the ICICI Bank YouTube Channel and remember to press the bell icon to get notifications on our latest products and services offerings. \nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/icicibank/videos?sub_confirmation=1\n\nThere is more than one way to connect with us, so be sure to check our ICICI Bank at:\nWebsite: https://www.icicibank.com\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/icicibank\nLinkedIn: https://in.linkedin.com/company/icici-bank\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/icicibank\"", "channel_id": "UCDsxd7FVq